1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":961794834,"text":"あんたはずっと「霜月の子」へ行きたいと思ってた、そうだろ？","nextNodeIds":[761260206]},{"nodeId":761260206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":1363932130,"text":"だから、リーリキと仲良くなって、「霜月の子」を案内してもらいたいとおもってる。","nextNodeIds":[761260207]},{"nodeId":761260207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7046,"speakerName":"ゾンパイコ","textMapHash":3278455658,"text":"えっ！？ネフェルさん、知ってたのか？絶対誰にも言わず、心に留めてきたのに…","nextNodeIds":[761260208]},{"nodeId":761260208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2555456938,"text":"（今こそ、あの決めセリフを！うーん、ネフェル姐さんはなんて言ってたっけ…えっと…あっ！）","nextNodeIds":[761260209]},{"nodeId":761260209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":601387578,"text":"ゾンパイコさん。秘密を守りたいんなら、「秘密を守っている」ことを隠す方法も学ばないとね。","nextNodeIds":[761260210]},{"nodeId":761260210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2001627658,"text":"じゃないと、いくら心の中に「壁」を築いても、簡単に穴が開いてしまう。","nextNodeIds":[761260211]},{"nodeId":761260211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7046,"speakerName":"ゾンパイコ","textMapHash":3853361762,"text":"はぁ…故郷にいた頃は、何も隠し事なんてなかったのにな…","nextNodeIds":[761260212]},{"nodeId":761260212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":1846863058,"text":"（…決まった！練習の甲斐があったな、へへへへへ——）","nextNodeIds":[761260213]},{"nodeId":761260213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7046,"speakerName":"ゾンパイコ","textMapHash":4050052402,"text":"まあいい。そこまでわかってるんなら、頼まれてくれないか？俺は外国人だし、いきなりリーリキさんのとこに行くのは…","nextNodeIds":[761260214]},{"nodeId":761260214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2782434738,"text":"大丈夫だよ。リーリキはとても親切だし、訪問者が外国人だろうと人外だろうと、優しく迎え入れてくれるさ。","nextNodeIds":[761260215]},{"nodeId":761260215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7046,"speakerName":"ゾンパイコ","textMapHash":3911091762,"text":"えっ？そうなのか…？","nextNodeIds":[761260216]},{"nodeId":761260216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7046,"speakerName":"ゾンパイコ","textMapHash":720179458,"text":"いや…でも、やっぱりいきなりお邪魔するのは気が引けるな。あの、もし彼女と知り合いなんだったら…","nextNodeIds":[761260217]},{"nodeId":761260217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2539480490,"text":"もちろん知り合いだよ。ちょうど今、食事も配り終えた頃だろうし…行こうか。","nextNodeIds":[761260218]},{"nodeId":761260218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":3174060962,"text":"あっ…ボスが、今回はタダでいいって言ってたよ。","nextNodeIds":[761260219]},{"nodeId":761260219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7046,"speakerName":"ゾンパイコ","textMapHash":251893746,"text":"ありがとう、ヤフォダさん…！すぐに支度してくるよ…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7612602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["7046"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7612603,"order":3,"stepDescription":"ゾンパイコと一緒にリーリキを訪ねる","stepDescTextMapHash":2494012092,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7612601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["7058"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7612601],"talks":[{"ta